Announcing Slash'EM version 0.0.7E5 (development) ... 

Version 0.0.7E5 is the latest alpha release in the current development
branch of Slash'EM. We are hoping it will also be the last and that the
next version will be our first beta release of version 0.0.7.

Summary of changes made:

Now based on the NetHack 3.4.3 codebase.
Torches must now be wielded (and not simply held) in order to be lit.
Deep dragons are now level-drain instead of disintegration resistant.
Explosives (and especially stacked explosives) can now combine to produce
larger explosions.
Better compression of png tilesets leading to smaller files and faster startup.
Improvements to GtkHack:
	A troubleshooting dialog to help tracking problems with NhExt
	Smoother scrolling
	You can now select the font to use in help windows

Slash'EM homepage:
http://www.slashem.org/

Source is available from the main file download area:
http://sourceforge.net/project/showfiles.php?group_id=9746

